instancemethods::

method:: aid

Opens the given string in the help system or in the default application of the userʼs OS.
If the string resembles an HTML filename or a URL, it is opened directly via link::Classes/HelpBrowser#*goTo::.
Otherwise, the corresponding documentation or file is opened when available.
If multiple related documents exist, or none is found, the help search page displays the results.

argument:: path

Accepts the names of classes, methods, documentation titles, documentation summaries, web addresses, and local file paths.

discussion::
See link::Guides/AID::.